Hi,

Note to the list moderator:
I hope this e-mail won't be regurgited in HTML by the loosy MTA we have
here.
In such a case, let me know, and I'll resend it clean from a private
account.


For anyone that has to work under a Solaris system, I've ported the
mkfs.jffs2
command so it compiles with GCC/Solaris/sparc. Generated images have been 
tested OK on a Walnut derived 405GP board.

A patch against the 20030803 snapshot is attached. The util/Makefile may
need assorted extra include directives for your system and linux headers.

Because mkfs.jffs2 is rather Linux centric, I do not solicit cvs inclusion.
I hope the mail archiver will prove again its helpfuless, should someone 
feel the need for such a patch.

Thanks for all,

Cheers
Stephane
from western France


